 "endings": {
  "E1": {
   "title": "雾退之夜",
   "kind": "true",
   "text": "你们带着探路队走出苔墓时,雾已经开始回涌。艾琳娜走在最后,一遍遍念着那个刚找回来的名字。",
   "image_prompt": "dawn after the fog lifting night, a small party leading a rescued scout team out of a moss-covered tomb gate, the silver-haired healer looking back at the stars",
   "assets": {
    "image": "assets/ending-E1.jpg"
   }
  },
  "E2": {
   "title": "北路的主人",
   "kind": "alt",
   "text": "商会的车队到的时候,北路上已经插满了矿工会的旗。独眼虎把鹤嘴锄扛在肩上,冲你点了点头。",
   "image_prompt": "miners' banners planted along a mountain post road at dawn, a big one-eyed bandit chief with a pickaxe nodding, stranded merchant wagons halted below",
   "assets": {
    "image": "assets/ending-E2.jpg"
   }
  },
  "E3": {
   "title": "灯还亮着",
   "kind": "alt",
   "text": "天亮前你们回到了镇上。米拉抱着阿沐哭了很久。艾琳娜的过去还留在那口棺材里,没有人去问。",
   "image_prompt": "an innkeeper hugging her younger brother in the warm doorway of a riverside inn at dawn, fog returning in the street behind",
   "assets": {
    "image": "assets/ending-E3.jpg"
   }
  },
  "E9": {
   "title": "雾合上了",
   "kind": "fail",
   "text": "雾从北路上合拢,像什么都没有发生过。明年的这一夜,镇署的册子上又不会多写一个名字。",
   "image_prompt": "thick fog closing over an empty north road, a single lantern left on the ground, cold blue-grey",
   "assets": {
    "image": "assets/ending-E9.jpg"
   }
  }
 },
 "prompt": {
  "entries": [
   {
    "id": "guide",
    "text": "隐藏主线:出北门前要凑齐三样——出北门的许可(公会委托 / 镇署通行令 / 卡斯)、雾里的路(老苇的旧雾路图 / 米拉的护身符 / 罗文)、驿路怎么过(打下山贼营地 / 和独眼虎谈 / 坐老鱼的船)。在自然时机让镇上的人提到这些,不要列清单。",
    "when": "always"
   },
   {
